{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/118-chou-mou/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/118-chou-mou/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 綢繆 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 唐風 · 綢繆 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《綢繆》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"118-chou-mou","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/118-chou-mou/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"118-chou-mou","title":"綢繆","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"tangfeng","path":["風","唐風","綢繆"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"綢繆束薪","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"三星在天","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"今夕何夕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"見此良人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"子兮子兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"如此良人何","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"綢繆束芻","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"三星在隅","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"今夕何夕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"見此邂逅","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"子兮子兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"如此邂逅何","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"綢繆束楚","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"三星在户","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"今夕何夕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"見此粲者","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"子兮子兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"如此粲者何","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"賀新昏也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《綢繆》三章，章六句。此賀新昏詩耳。「今夕何夕」等語，男女初昏之夕，自有此惝怳情形景象，不必添出國亂民貧、男女失時之言，始見其爲欣慶詞也。詩咏新昏多矣，皆各有命意所在。唯此詩無甚深義，只描摹男女初遇，神情逼真，自是絶作，不可廢也。若必篇篇有爲而作，恐自然天籟反難索已。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"三星〔姚氏際恒曰〕三，參通。《毛傳》謂「參」，是也。〔案〕參星中三星最明，俗通謂之三星。良人〔馮氏復京曰〕《儀禮》鄭注云：「婦人稱夫曰良。」粲美也。〔張氏彩曰〕粲者，華美之意，意以女之服貌爲言。〔《集傳》〕此爲夫語婦之詞也。子兮〔姚氏際恒曰〕一章「子兮」指二女，「二女」，姚際恒《詩經通論》無「二」字。二章「子兮」合指，三章「子兮」指男。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"薪十一真。天一先。人十一真。通韻。芻七虞。隅同。逅二十六宥，叶狼口反。叶韻。楚六語。户七麌。者二十一馬，叶章與反。叶韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
